[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573913805","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100521#issuecomment-2573913805","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100521","id":2573913805,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zas7N","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T20:58:25Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T20:58:25Z","body":"CC @kitbdev maybe to review CodeEdit changes?\r\n\r\nAnd @HolonProduction for `CodeCompletionOption` changes at core level. Seems very specific of a change and I wonder what it means for potential future similar additions that may make the function a bit unwieldy or require breaking compat. But I haven't really formalized thoughts around it, that's just a gut feeling.\r\nOne idea (again, uncooked) is maybe that this is too specific to add to the constructor, but could still be a struct member (defaulting to `false`) that can be set manually on the struct after constructing in the rare occurrences where it's relevant?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573913805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2574652221","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100521#issuecomment-2574652221","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100521","id":2574652221,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZdhM9","user":{"login":"Chaosus","id":3036176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzYxNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T08:18:07Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T08:18:07Z","body":"I've kinda lost a mind connection with this PR, if anyone wants to take it and continue - you're welcome.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2574652221/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2575924292","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100521#issuecomment-2575924292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100521","id":2575924292,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZiXxE","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T18:04:54Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T18:04:54Z","body":"I don't know this much about the whole shader editor stuff so not sure whats technically possible, but my general approach/ideal for our completion tech would be to align it as closely as possible to LSP so that we can reuse as much stuff as possible. This whole swizzle feature in this PR is implemented in a way that we can't map to LSP which I don't really like. (There is no GDShader LSP at the moment AFAIK but I think it came up in some proposal that I can't find at the moment. I don't think we should work in a direction that would make this harder to achieve.)\r\n\r\nI think this should be doable without adjusting the \"frontend\" just by using our existing completion option model. Also I don't think this feature is that common, thus IMO it fits more into the language specific completion implementation than `TextEdit`.\r\n\r\nEach swizzle option can also be represented as an option with a different insert text.\r\nE.g.\r\n```\r\nv.xy➡\r\n{diyplay: \"z\", insertText: \"xyz\"}\r\n```\r\nThe main thing to figure out here is basically that a new completion request would have to happen for each char typed, so that we can update the display and insert text. This is where I don't know how the shader editor works, but in general I feel like this should be doable.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2575924292/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2575940321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100521#issuecomment-2575940321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100521","id":2575940321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zibrh","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T18:13:13Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T18:13:13Z","body":"Just for reference, https://glsl.app/ this online shader editor allows autocomplete for swizzling (using monaco/vscode).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2575940321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]